{"timestamp": 1779333626.544563, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 22, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Eve"}, {"room": "lower_engine", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779333626.545017, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 22, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779333640.185141, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I reported Eve\u2019s body in Security. My route was cafeteria \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security.\n\nI saw Frank in oxygen around tick 3, then he left toward upper engine. Later I saw Frank in lower engine around tick 9 and he left back toward upper engine at tick 10. I saw Alice alive in storage around ticks 14-15, and she left storage toward lower engine at tick 16. Then I passed through medbay and electrical, saw Frank again in electrical around tick 20, and when I got to security I found Eve dead there.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Bob or Charlie at all this round. I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but Frank was the last person I saw near electrical/security before I found Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779333655.225219, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 back to upper engine \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical. I was in electrical doing my task when the meeting got called.\n\nI can confirm seeing Diana in oxygen early, then again in lower engine around tick 9-10, and I saw her pass through electrical and leave toward security around tick 20. I never went into security or storage this round, and I didn\u2019t see Alice, Eve, Bob, or Charlie at all.\n\nDiana reporting Eve in security lines up with her leaving electrical into security, but it also means she was the only person I personally saw heading that way right before the report. Not hard accusing, just saying that\u2019s the only movement I can confirm. Bob and Charlie being unseen by both of us is also important."}}
{"timestamp": 1779333673.4530072, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was navigation \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper engine.\n\nImportant sightings: I saw Alice leave security toward navigation around tick 5. I never saw her again after that. Then in weapons I saw Eve enter from cafeteria around tick 7, and Bob entered weapons from cafeteria around tick 8. Bob and Eve were both in weapons around ticks 8-9. At tick 10, I saw Eve leave weapons toward security, while Bob was still in weapons at that moment.\n\nSo for Eve\u2019s body in Security: I can confirm Eve was alive in weapons and headed toward Security around tick 10. Bob was the last person I saw with her before that, and then Diana found her much later in Security. Frank being in electrical around tick 20 is vouched by both Diana and Frank seeing each other, but Bob\u2019s path after weapons is the big missing piece for me.\n\nNot hard locking, but Bob needs to explain where he went after weapons, because from my info he had the clearest opportunity on Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779333706.628761, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Charlie\u2019s timeline is mostly right, but he\u2019s leaving out the important part that Eve was alive after I left Weapons.\n\nMy route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 through security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 lower engine. In Weapons I saw Charlie and Eve, yes. Eve left toward Security around tick 10 while I was still on Weapons. I finished up there, then when I passed through Security toward Navigation around tick 12, Eve was alive in Security. I did not see a body there.\n\nAfter that I went Navigation, then Storage, then Lower Engine for fuel. I didn\u2019t see Diana or Frank at all, which lines up with them being mostly left/electrical side.\n\nSo if Eve died in Security, it was after I passed through and saw her alive. Diana is the one who actually found/reporting it much later, and Frank was right next to Security in Electrical around then. I\u2019m not saying it\u2019s definitely either of them, but Charlie framing me as \u201clast with Eve\u201d is wrong \u2014 Eve was alive in Security after Weapons."}}
{"timestamp": 1779333726.7959921, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Given both deaths, Bob\u2019s route worries me the most. He places himself passing through Security after Eve went there, then going Navigation \u2192 Storage \u2192 Lower Engine, which is also exactly the side Alice headed toward after I saw her alive in Storage at tick 15 and leaving to Lower Engine at tick 16.\n\nSo Bob had possible opportunity on Eve in Security and then on Alice near Lower Engine. Frank was in Electrical when I passed through right before I found Eve, but I didn\u2019t see him in Security. Charlie\u2019s story also matches Eve going toward Security earlier.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Bob unless he has a really strong explanation for Alice\u2019s death too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779333738.476367, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my info: I started oxygen, saw Diana come in from cafeteria around tick 3-4, then I went upper engine \u2192 lower engine. Diana came into lower engine from upper engine around tick 9 and we were both there briefly, then I went back upper engine \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical. I was doing my electrical task when Diana passed through and left toward security at tick 20, then she reported.\n\nI never entered security or storage, and I never saw Bob, Charlie, Alice, or Eve this round.\n\nBased on everyone\u2019s stories, Bob\u2019s route is the one that overlaps both deaths the most. Charlie says Eve left weapons toward security, and Bob admits he went through security after that. Then Bob says he went navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 lower engine, which lines up with where Diana last saw Alice going from storage toward lower engine. That\u2019s two possible opportunities on both dead players.\n\nDiana could technically self-report Eve, but her route matches what I saw, and she didn\u2019t have the same connection to Alice. I\u2019m leaning Bob here unless the last speaker has something that clears him."}}
{"timestamp": 1779333758.577188, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019m with the Bob lean here. My info hasn\u2019t changed: I saw Eve in Weapons with Bob, Eve left toward Security at tick 10, and Bob was still in Weapons then. Bob saying he saw Eve alive in Security later is completely self-vouched \u2014 nobody else confirms that.\n\nThe bigger issue is the Alice kill. Diana says Alice was alive in Storage around tick 14-15 and left toward Lower Engine at tick 16. Bob\u2019s claimed route after Security is Navigation \u2192 Storage \u2192 Lower Engine, which lines up way too closely with that. So Bob\u2019s route overlaps Eve\u2019s likely death location and then Alice\u2019s last known path.\n\nFrank and Diana at least partially confirm each other near Electrical right before the report. I don\u2019t have anything that clears Bob, and he\u2019s the only one whose route fits both bodies. I think we should vote Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779333782.528775, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I get why my route looks bad on paper, but the timing being used against me is off.\n\nFor Eve: Charlie is only confirming Eve left Weapons toward Security at tick 10. I\u2019m telling you I passed Security after that and Eve was alive there around tick 12. If I killed Eve there, why would I then openly admit I went through Security? That would be insane. The only people near Security much later are Diana and Frank \u2014 Diana literally reports there after coming from Electrical, and Frank was in Electrical right beside that path.\n\nFor Alice: yes, I ended in Lower Engine, and Alice was there when I arrived around tick 20. She was alive on my screen and then the meeting got called shortly after. I did not see a body or I would\u2019ve reported it. Diana saw Alice leave Storage toward Lower Engine at tick 16, but that doesn\u2019t mean I killed her \u2014 it means Alice was alive and moving that way. Anyone from Upper Engine could also get there, and Charlie ended Upper Engine by his own route.\n\nWhat worries me is everyone is treating Charlie\u2019s framing like it\u2019s confirmed. Charlie says I\u2019m \u201clast with Eve,\u201d but I saw Eve alive after Weapons. Diana self-reported Eve in Security and Frank is the only person confirmed near that area right before report. I think this is being pushed too neatly onto me. I\u2019m leaning Diana or Frank here, not voting myself obviously."}}
